      "text": "Route status: likely OK (estimated from map data, not checked)\nThere is a likely OK walking route from Surau Al Mahdi to Surau At Taqwa, about 364 m, roughly 5 minutes on foot. It runs mainly along Jalan Metafasa U16/3.\n1. Start at Surau Al Mahdi and head to the nearest mapped path to the surau.\n2. Follow Jalan Metafasa U16/3 for most of the route (about 364 m in total).\n3. Cross at the one mapped unmarked crossing near the end of the route.\n4. Arrive at Surau At Taqwa, using the nearest mapped path to the surau.\nWorth knowing:\n• Likely OK (estimated from map data, not checked).\n• About 352 m follows road centre lines without a mapped sidewalk; sidewalk access is not verified.\n• This route uses 1 road crossing: 1 unmarked (map data, not checked).\n• Route starts at the nearest mapped path to Surau Al Mahdi; its entrance is not mapped.\n• Route ends at the nearest mapped path to Surau At Taqwa; its entrance is not mapped.\n• Sidewalk status on Jalan Metafasa U16/3 is not checked yet.\n• Outside the detailed study area (Elmina Urban Park + Lakeside Mall frontage), path and place facts come from OpenStreetMap only.",
